@startuml context-flow
title Blaine — context forms and provenance
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentBackgroundColor<<proposed>> #FFF2CC

database "Authoritative Project /\nExternal Sources" as Sources <<evidence>>
database "Artifact Store\nprior plans, outputs, evidence" as Artifacts
component "Context Catalog\ndiscovery aid" as Catalog <<proposed>>
component "Context Retrieval\nand Preparation" as Retrieval
artifact "Selected Working Context\nwith source provenance" as Selected
artifact "Exact Evidence /\nSafe Summaries" as Represented
component "Protected Transformation\nlocal only" as Transform <<proposed>>
artifact "Cloud Context Packet\nfor external use" as Packet

Sources --> Retrieval : discover / retrieve
Artifacts --> Retrieval : addressable prior work
Catalog ..> Retrieval : aid discovery
Retrieval --> Selected : select relevant context
Selected --> Represented : preserve exact or summarize safely
Selected --> Transform : protected content when required
Transform --> Packet : permitted transformed form
Represented --> Packet : bounded external representation

note right of Sources
  Remain sources of truth.
end note

note right of Selected
  Selection retains provenance;
  derived forms do not replace sources.
end note

note bottom of Catalog
  Proposed; not a source of truth.
end note

note bottom of Transform
  Proposed; transformation is local
  and grants no egress permission.
end note

note bottom of Packet
  Created only when external use is required.
  Authorization mechanics are not shown.
end note
@enduml
